WEBVTT

00:01:29.263 --> 00:01:34.163
Once I and so many people
experience acceptance,

00:01:34.197 --> 00:01:35.763
we want more.

00:01:35.797 --> 00:01:38.630
Acceptance isn't enough
for our generation.

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:40.030
I think we want meaning.

00:01:40.063 --> 00:01:43.697
And I believe meaning is the sixth stage.

00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:45.263
And when we talk about meaning,

00:01:45.297 --> 00:01:49.630
I always like to point out
there's no meaning in a horrible death

00:01:49.663 --> 00:01:50.963
or in a pandemic

00:01:50.963 --> 00:01:54.730
or in a wedding being canceled
or a job being lost.

00:01:55.063 --> 00:01:57.730
The meaning isn't in the horrible event.

00:01:57.763 --> 00:01:59.663
The meaning is in us.

00:01:59.697 --> 00:02:02.397
It's what we find afterwards.